== 7_bad.mvcc
! 7_bad.mvcc line 2: unknown level snapshot
! 7_bad.mvcc line 3: t9 has no begin before this line
! 7_bad.mvcc line 4: put takes a key and a value
! 7_bad.mvcc line 5: a value cannot be -
! 7_bad.mvcc line 6: add needs a whole number
! 7_bad.mvcc line 7: tear needs a byte count
! 7_bad.mvcc line 8: vacuum takes no arguments
! 7_bad.mvcc line 9: unknown command launch
! 7_bad.mvcc line 10: unknown action frobnicate
! 7_bad.mvcc line 11: begin takes a name and an optional level
